 style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Therefore, <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*e=n!*(sum k=0 to n of 1/k!) + n!*(sum k=n+1 to infinity of 1/k!)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__mathit">e</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.302113em; height: 2.9535100000000005em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.49em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=0</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.360444em; height: 3.0118410000000004em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>. Since we have shown that <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*e in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__mathit">e</span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span>,&nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*(sum k=0 to n of 1/k!) + n!*(sum k=n+1 to infinity of 1/k!) in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.302113em; height: 2.9535100000000005em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.49em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=0</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.360444em; height: 3.0118410000000004em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;by substitution&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text"> by substitution</span></span></span></span></span>.&nbsp; Further, we know that&nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*(sum k=0 to n of 1/k!) in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.302113em; height: 2.9535100000000005em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.49em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=0</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span> by <strong>lemma 4</strong>&nbsp;since it is the sum of integers. Furthermore, we can rearrange the formula to be <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*(sum k=n+1 to infinity of 1/k!)=n!*e-n!*(sum k=0 to n of 1/k!)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.360444em; height: 3.0118410000000004em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__mathit">e</span><span class="ML__cmr">&minus;</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.302113em; height: 2.9535100000000005em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.49em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=0</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>. And since,&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*e in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__mathit">e</span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span> and &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;-(n!*(sum k=0 to n of 1/k!)) in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&minus;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.302113em; height: 3.0521130000000003em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.302113em; height: 2.9535100000000005em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.49em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=0</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span>, it follows that their sum must also be in&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;\\mathbb{Z}&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span>: <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*e-n!*(sum k=0 to n of 1/k!) in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__mathit">e</span><span class="ML__cmr">&minus;</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.302113em; height: 2.9535100000000005em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.49em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=0</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span> . Therefore,&nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*(sum k=n+1 to infinity of 1/k!) in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.360444em; height: 3.0118410000000004em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;by substitution&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text"> by substitution</span></span></span></span></span>. In order to reach a contradiction we will now show that this expression cannot be an integer.&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;Since <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;0&lt;1&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;by arithmetic&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text"> by arithmetic</span></span></span></span></span>, it follows that&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;0 &lt;1 leq n&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span><span class="ML__cmr">&le;</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span></span>. Therefore, by transitivity&nbsp;we know that <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;0 &lt;n&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span></span>. Therefore, by&nbsp;<strong>lemma 3</strong>,&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*(sum k=n+1 to infinity of 1/k!) &lt; (1/(n+1)) * (sum k=0 to infinity of (1/(n+1))^k)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.360444em; he