ass="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.73em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size3">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.686em; height: 1.8304399999999998em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size2">(</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.44em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.73em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size2">)</span></span></span></span><span style="top: -2.09em;"><span style="height: 1.84em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.44em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">since <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;(1/(n+1))* ((n+1)/n)\n=1/n&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.7693300000000001em; height: 1.91377em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size3">(</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.73em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size3">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.686em; height: 1.8304399999999998em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size2">(</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.44em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.73em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size2">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.44em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;by algebra&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text"> by algebra</span></span></span></span></span>.&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</p>
<p>Recall from above that&nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*(sum k=n+1 to infinity of 1/k!) &lt; (1/(n+1)) * (sum k=0 to infinity of (1/(n+1))^k)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.360444em; height: 3.0118410000000004em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.7693300000000001em; height: 1.91377em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size3">(</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.73em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size3">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.302113em; height: 2.9680210000000002em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.49em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=0</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.7693300000000001em; height: 1.91377em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size3">(</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.73em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size3">)</span></span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.67em;"><span style="top: -4.17em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.49em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span></span></span></span></span> by <strong>lemma 3.&nbsp;</strong>Therefore, <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*(sum k=n+1 to infinity of 1/k!) &lt; 1/n&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.360444em; height: 3.0118410000000004em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.44em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;by substitution&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text"> by substitution</span></span></span></span></span>.&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>It is obviously true that&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;0&lt;n!&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span></span></span> and we know that&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;0 &lt;(sum k=n+1 to infinity of 1/k!)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.360444em; height: 3.0118410000000004em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>since it is sum of positive terms (<strong>lemma 2</strong>). Therefore, by closure of positives under multiplication, their product must also be positive: &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;0&lt; n!*(sum k=n+1 to infinity of 1/k!)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.360444em; height: 3.0118410000000004em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>. In addition, since <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;1 leq n&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span><span class="ML__cmr">&le;</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span></span>, &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;1/n leq 1&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.44em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&le;</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span></span> by<strong> lemma 1.&nbsp;</strong></p>
<p>Therefore,</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*(sum k=n+1 to infinity of 1/k!) &lt; 1/n\nleq 1&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mtable"><span class="col-align-r"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 2.56em;"><span style="top: -4.55em;"><span style="height: 3.42em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.360444em; height: 3.0118410000000004em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="col-align-l"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 2.56em;"><span style="top: -4.55em;"><span style="height: 3.42em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.44em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="top: -2.05em;"><span style="height: 1.2em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">&le;</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">So we can conclude that&nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*(sum k=n+1 to infinity of 1/k!)&lt;1 &quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.360444em; height: 3.0118410000000004em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span></span>. This means that&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;0&lt; n!*(sum k=n+1 to infinity of 1/k!)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.360444em; height: 3.0118410000000004em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span></span></span></span></span> and since <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;0+1=1&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;by arithmetic&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text"> by arithmetic</span></span></span></span></span>,&nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*(sum k=n+1 to infinity of 1/k!)&lt;0+1 &quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.360444em; height: 3.0118410000000004em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;by substitution&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text"> by substitution</span></span></span></span></span>. However, no integer is between two consecutive integers. Therefore, since <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;1-1 in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span><span class="ML__cmr">&minus;</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span> , <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;0 in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;by substitution&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text"> by substitution</span></span></span></span></span>. Therefore,&nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*(sum k=n+1 to infinity of 1/k!) notin ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.360444em; height: 3.0118410000000004em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&notin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span>. However, we have already asserted that <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;n!*(sum k=n+1 to infinity of 1/k!) in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -1.360444em; height: 3.0118410000000004em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size4">(</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.55em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+1</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size4">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span>.&nbsp; Thus we have shown a contradiction, <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;contradiction&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&rarr;&larr;</span></span></span></span></span>.&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<p>Therefore, we can conclude that <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;e is not rational&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">e</span><span class="ML__text"> is not rational</span></span></span></span></span>.&nbsp;Therefore, <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;e is irrational&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">e</span><span class="ML__text"> is irrational</span></span></span></span></span>.&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
